{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t蘋果公司新款手機開放預購後，懷疑再出現信用卡盜刷潮。警方表示，截至今早9時，共接獲130人懷疑信用卡被盜用於網上購買智能電話的報案，涉及金額約500萬元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n案件均暫列「以欺騙手段取得財產」，交由網絡安全及科技罪案調查科跟進調查。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：鍾慧儀\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T06:59:02.873931+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:20:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:38:11.865834+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:57:54.260218+00:00","content_hash":"b371416faeea703fe431df2d1cfa5b31a3a92560813614d77c6fed8cf755da3d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}